{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國太空探索技術公司（SpaceX）正進一步加快其「Starmind（星際大腦）」太空計算衞星網絡建設步伐。根據最新披露的信息，SpaceX已與德國設備製造商SINGULUS TECHNOLOGIES達成新的供應合作協議，為其大規模生產高性能太陽能電池提供關鍵製造設備。公司計劃通過這一合作，最終形成每年100吉瓦發電能力所需的太陽能電池生產規模，以滿足未來龐大的太空人工智能計算需求。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585934.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T10:16:24.584244+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T10:08:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T10:09:35.631078+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T10:09:35.631078+00:00","content_hash":"2a4a90ec2b0800d83e6efc37f38cfca83d383239e344a9f9d0e0f2825d668424","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}